      "evidence": "BJX fork Resources/Battles.json Id 33 ('Dark Spore Depths (the live dungeon: Necrolaceous's fungal army through the mush'): scene bw_mo_mushrooms, 5 groups standing at the start, 1 coming later, the boss Necrolaceous last; every spot is the fork's."
